<title>PORTUGAL: Yield rises slightly on Portuguese 182-day bills.</title>
<headline>Yield rises slightly on Portuguese 182-day bills.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average yield rose slightly to 5.9815 percent, from 5.9317 percent previously, at the Treasury's sale of 182-day bills, the Bank of Portugal said.</p>
<p>The Treasury placed all of the 25 billion escudos on offer.</p>
<p>--LISBON BUREAU 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
